    <summary>Batch watermark photos &amp; PDFs locally with AI/crop protection &amp; EXIF scrubbing.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Watermark hundreds of photos and PDFs in seconds on your own PC — with AI/crop removal protection, CSV auto-fill, batch resizing, and one-click GPS/EXIF scrubbing.

Smarter Watermark Protection: Shows you the best spot to place your watermark so people can't easily crop it out or erase it with AI tools — complete with a live Protection Score and a one-click boost. Watermark Whole Folders at Once: Drop in hundreds of photos (including subfolders) and process them all in one go while keeping your exact folder layout intact. Hide Private Info in One Click: Automatically remove hidden GPS locations, camera serial numbers, and hidden preview thumbnails so you never accidentally share your home or client's address. Auto-Fill Names, Dates & Codes: Automatically stamp different text onto each photo (such as client names, product codes, or dates) from a simple spreadsheet (CSV) or the photo's built-in details.

Licensing: PixelMark is commercial software and requires a paid license key (£9.99 one-time purchase for 1 PC at a time, personal & commercial use included, 1 year of free updates included — keeps working forever after 1 year with optional £4.99/year updates only if wanted, no auto-renewal, online activation and 14-day periodic licence check required; no free trial and no recurring subscription). Purchase at https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=pixelmark.]]></description>
